<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: LGT Bank optimistic for second half.</title>
<headline>LGT Bank optimistic for second half.</headline>
<dateline>VADUZ, Liechtenstein 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>LGT Bank in Liechtenstein, the Vaduz-based private banking unit of Liechtenstein Global Trust, said it was optimistic for the second half of 1997.</p>
</text>
